<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Name that to our hearts is nearest,</l><l>Here the stricken soul doth hide;</l><l>Name that to our hearts is dearest,</l><l>As in Jesus we confide.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>“Call Him Jesus!” He shall save us</l><l>From the tyranny of sin;</l><l>From its condemnation save us,</l><l>From iniquity within.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Thanks we give, and adoration,</l><l>Every day and every hour,</l><l>For an uttermost salvation,</l><l>Freedom from sin’s guilt and power.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Jesus! sweetest note of any</l><l>In the lowly pilgrim’s song;</l><l>Jesus! the triumphant music</l><l>Of the bright angelic throng.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Earth to Him her face upraises,</l><l>Knows Him as the great I AM!</l><l>Heaven resounds with Jesus’ praises,</l><l>Glory to the bleeding Lamb!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
